      "title": "Average Prompt Score Over Time",
      "description": "The headline quality metric over time: mean score of all served variants, weighted by traffic.\n\nA step change marks the moment the flag was changed; a gradual move means a progressive rollout is shifting the traffic mix. The dashed lines are the same thresholds as the stat above.",
