    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Average Cost per Request",
      "description": "Average simulated model cost (USD) of one chat request at the current prompt mix, derived from the `prompt-cost` tracking events as rate(sum) ÷ rate(count).\n\nThe API draws a random cost per request within a range per variant — unreliable $0.0004–0.0008 · brief $0.0008–0.0015 · casual $0.0015–0.0030 · expert $0.0040–0.0080 — to mimic token usage: richer prompts and longer answers cost more.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 29
      },
      "datasource": "$metrics_ds",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(feature_flag_tracking_value_sum{feature_flag_tracking_event_name=\"prompt-cost\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum(rate(feature_flag_tracking_value_count{feature_flag_tracking_event_name=\"prompt-cost\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "Cost/request"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD",
          "decimals": 4,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Spend Rate",
      "description": "Projected spend per hour: the per-second sum of tracked `prompt-cost` values × 3600.\n\nIt reflects both the request rate and the prompt mix, so it rises when the flag routes more users to expensive variants and drops to 0 when the load generator stops.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 29
